# Closed ESX-team Issues

This ledger preserves ESX-team findings, proposed fixes, landed implementation evidence,
and effectiveness results separately from ESX transformation issues.

## Template for Closed Entries

```markdown
## 🟢 VERIFIED: [Brief title]

**Date Identified**: YYYY-MM-DD  HH:MM
**Date Resolved**: YYYY-MM-DD  HH:MM
**Status**: Verified effective | Implemented/validated | Superseded | False positive
**UUID**: TEAM-AREA-SHORT-NAME-001
**Category**: stable_lowercase_category
**Severity**: Critical | High | Medium | Low
**Assessment**: devel-loop/self-improvement/assessments/YYYY-MM-DD-name/assessment.md
**Anchors**: path[:symbol|:line]; ...
**Implementation-Commit**: 7-to-40-character commit hash
**Validation-Evidence**: repository-relative validation-receipt.json#sha256 (required hash)
**Effectiveness-Evidence**: repository-relative measurement.json#sha256 (required for Verified effective)

### Issue
[Original measured inefficiency or procedural defect.]

### Evidence
[Evidence that motivated the proposed fix.]

### Potential Impact
[Original consequence.]

### Proposed Fix
[Original proposed correction.]

### Implementation
[What landed, including deviations from the proposal.]

### Validation
[Exact command, exit status, and retained evidence.]

### Remaining Limitations
[Boundaries, unknowns, or successor UUID; say none only when justified.]
```
